# ---------------------------------------------------Terraform Scipts-----------------------------------------
# HCL/TCL - Hashicorp corporation language / Terraform configuration language.
# Terraform scripts ---
# Should end with .tf extension
# File Name can be anything
# Terraform terminalogy
# Provides -- is the cloud provider name (like AWS, AZURE, GCP, IBM )
# Resources -- anything we create on the cloud we create is called a resource. ( ec2, s3, s3key)
# Two Imp things inside a terraform scripts ----

# Are always key = value pair.
# Ex: name = naresh

# Blocks (like dictionary ) - is a section that defines something.
# Blocks can be of different types like:- Provider Block, Variable Block, Output Block and Resource Block.
# 

blocktype " "resource we want to create" "purpose" {

}
